{"id": "EUVD-2026-96572", "enisaUuid": "0e9fa4a9-8b82-3501-9620-b74ee2e3dd67", "description": "JeecgBoot through 3.9.5 contains a missing authorization vulnerability that allows low-privileged authenticated users to create department permission bindings via POST /sys/sysDepartPermission/add. Attackers can submit arbitrary departId, permissionId and dataRuleIds fields to attach menu, button and data rule grants to any department for delegation to its roles.", "datePublished": "2026-10-10T21:49:27", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T02:33:51", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/AnkesKasty/cve-request-poc/blob/a7b6d1423555812d8efa26c91c5d0683164b31e5/JeecgBoot/poc_depart_permission_add.py", "https://github.com/jeecgboot/JeecgBoot/blob/e3b9dc0aefe1943d9772b026f64ed671a7c82802/jeecg-boot/jeecg-module-system/jeecg-system-biz/src/main/java/org/jeecg/modules/system/controller/SysDepartPermissionController.java#L92-L97", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/jeecgboot-through-3.9.5-missing-authorization-via-sys-sysdepartpermission-add"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-108633", "GHSA-8m49-5x23-469c"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.24, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "44f9c972-1264-3fde-be5b-3d21e7c796f9", "product": {"name": "JeecgBoot", "vendor": {"name": "n/a"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22643.9.5"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "f9ea0af6-7898-3f90-b311-381ff43c0b70", "vendor": {"name": "jeecgboot"}}], "isExploited": false}